WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.500
[Rain against the window of an interrogation room]

00:04.000 --> 00:07.500
INSPECTOR RAO: You told us you were home all night, Mr. Mehra.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.000
MEHRA: I was. My wife will tell you the same.

00:11.500 --> 00:15.500
INSPECTOR RAO: Your wife told us you left at eleven. In her car.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
[Mehra's hand stops halfway to his glass]

00:19.500 --> 00:23.500
MEHRA: She's confused. She takes pills to sleep.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.500
INSPECTOR RAO: Then explain why her car was on the toll camera at 11:40, near the farmhouse.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.500
MEHRA: Anyone could have taken that car.

00:33.000 --> 00:37.500
INSPECTOR RAO: Anyone with your fingerprints on the steering wheel and his blood on the seat?

00:38.000 --> 00:40.500
[Silence. Mehra stares at the table]

00:41.000 --> 00:45.500
MEHRA: I want my lawyer. Now.

00:46.000 --> 00:51.000
INSPECTOR RAO: Your lawyer is outside. He's the one who called us.

00:51.500 --> 00:54.500
[Mehra looks up, pale]
